Upstream: https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups/commit/6327a1572fcd62ab66aaaae8fa1c69fc022d459b
Reason: Backport the upstream fix for the HTTP upgrade logic with OPTIONS
        requests (OpenPrinting/cups#1766).

        The same patch moves the httpPrintf() buffer from the stack to the
        heap.  On musl the default thread stack size is 128 KiB, so the 64 KiB
        stack buffer of httpPrintf() overflows the stack and kills cupsd and
        the ipp backend with SIGSEGV.

--- a/cups/http-private.h
+++ b/cups/http-private.h
@@ -1,9 +1,9 @@
 /*
  * Private HTTP definitions for CUPS.
  *
